---
Load the full contents of a skill file by path.
---

Use this tool when a skill listed in the "Skills" section of the system
prompt is relevant to the current task, or when the user names a skill file
directly. Pass the skill's path; the tool returns its full contents so you
can follow it as an in-context instruction set. Only load a skill when you
are actually going to use it — its name and description are already in
context, so there's no need to load it just to check what it does.
